{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52239","headline":"咏竹（卒章） · 薛元超","name":"咏竹（卒章）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别有邻人笛，偏伤怀旧情。\n（廖彩梁《乾陵稽古》收崔融撰《大唐故中书令赠光禄大夫秦州都督薛公墓志铭》引。\n墓志爲近年於乾陵陪葬墓出土。\n）（〖1〗《薛公墓志铭》：「八岁，善属文。\n时房玄龄、虞世南试公咏竹，援毫立就，卒章云〖诗略〗。\n玄龄等即公之父党，深所感叹。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛元超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52239.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52239","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}